verything went as described. Highly recommended.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z"},{"id":5232445,"review":"Great location,  clean house, and superb host! Definitely recommended","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5239864,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5281805,"review":"Lovely place and hosts - highly recommend!","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5292081,"review":"It was a great stay felt like home very responsive and professional host I sure recommend it to try","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5324183,"review":"Tawila neighborhood is amazing, the Unit was very nice with very good and new furniture.\n\nThere was a problem with the cleanliness while checking in that was handled by the host, also the checkin wasn’t very smooth but not a big deal\n\nWorth to mention that there is inaccuracy in the listing description, as it is a townhouse not a twin house as advertised and the TV is not 65 inch","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5329561,"review":"Die Villa entsprach der Beschreibung und war sehr sauber. Die Lage ist wunderschön und der Pool ist fantastisch.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5332992,"review":"We had a great weekend at this property and everything went very well and smoothly.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5391518,"review":"We really enjoyed our stay and the host was very responsive when we faced any issues. They were extremely helpful and friendly!","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5414584,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5420155,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5455837,"review":"Positive:\nHome is new and view is amazing\n\nNegative:\nI little bit far from downtown and Marina","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5476483,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5550245,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5629695,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5633639,"review":"The place was beautiful, all the amenities were amazing, and the landlord is such a gentleman.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5669457,"review":"We had a nice stay overall, and Nada was a very kind, responsive, and supportive host. She was quick to help with any maintenance issues or missing items, and even provided a new pan when needed. The villa has good Wi-Fi and is generally comfortable.\n\nHowever, the property does need some maintenance. We spent around two hours with AC technicians fixing a few units, and the oven, cooker, and some plumbing also require attention. The pool is quite small, and the lagoon isn’t really suitable for swimming.\n\nThe outdoor space could be improved—it’s difficult to enjoy due to many geckos, and the chairs outside needed cleaning. There aren’t many activities nearby, and the beach isn’t accessible.\n\nDespite these issues, we appreciated Nada’s hospitality and efforts to make our stay as comfortable as possible.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5748443,"review":"Positive:\nCleanliness of the villa is really convenient. The management of the unit was splendid. Help was found whenever needed. As a whole, the stay was enjoyable.\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5750346,"review":"A truly lovely stay","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5752160,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5835623,"review":"Thank you xuru for delivering ama@ing service, cleanliness, communication, and for the reliability! Not just that, you also managed to save me in such short notice!!! The place was amazing, clean, just perfect for my family, my only concern was regarding the light that entered the room once the sun was out blackout is definitely not doing its job! Other than that its perfect! ","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5836513,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5845656,"review":"AMAZIIIIING and very clean","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5910594,"review":".","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5914486,"review":"We had a great stay at Xuru Stays — the place was clean, comfortable, and exactly as described. Check-in was easy, communication was quick, and everything we needed was available. Would definitely stay again.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":6097998,"review":"The units need hardcore maintenance as from the floor tiles till the Windows glass everything was terrible, tiles are not fitted well in place, the curtains are torn and not even the same size of the windows, bathroom counters and kitchen cabinets are broken, outdoor seating is rusted and even the AC remote has no batteries it was really miserable experience and definitely not recommended","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6098194,"review":"great duplex, with good view. \nshared pool was a great addition to have.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6146603,"review":"The property is very good, so clean, and a very nice place. The host is very friendly and helpful. I recommend it for everyone who needs to enjoy a beautiful vacation.","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6170561,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":209857,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}